{"id":"gedanke","lemma":"Gedanke","pos":"noun","rank":651,"glosses":["a thought [with an (+ accusative) ‘[of/about] (something)’]","idea, plan","concept"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈdaŋkə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/73/De-Gedanke.ogg/De-Gedanke.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Gedankens","plural":"Gedanken"},"formAudio":{"Gedankens":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Gedankens.wav","Gedanken":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/79/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Gedanken.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich kann eure Gedanken lesen.","en":"I can read your thoughts.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"your","l":"euer"},null,{"g":"to read"}]},{"text":"Was für ein Gedanke!","en":"What a thought!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566204","words":[null,null,{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"what"]]},{"text":"Der Gedanke zählt.","en":"It's the thought that counts.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to count","l":"zählen"}]},{"text":"Ich spiele mit dem Gedanken.","en":"I'm toying with the idea.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"a game","l":"Spiel"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Warum machst du dir darüber Gedanken?","en":"Why do you care about this?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"above"},null]}]}